{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You like big numbers? Sure, got you covered.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430340/extras/20fbf04e240ae2b2a5d257947c6e8af4.poster.avif?t=1773255943\" width=1170 height=514 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430340/extras/20fbf04e240ae2b2a5d257947c6e8af4.webm?t=1773255943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430340/extras/20fbf04e240ae2b2a5d257947c6e8af4.mp4?t=1773255943\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430340/extras/75f5f25dcc7d93781c3765ce254e23e2.avif?t=1773255943\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430340/extras_big/75f5f25dcc7d93781c3765ce254e23e2.webp?t=1773255943 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dice A Million is a roguelike deckbuilder about rolling dice to try and get to a million points. That's the whole <i>point</i>. (get it?!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're trapped in this dice rolling facility, so let's get rolling and try to escape. Combine the effects of more than <strong>120 different</strong> <strong>dice</strong> and discover <strong>powerful synergies</strong>. Get through ever-increasing debts and challenging bosses that will require perfect symbiosis in your bag in order to be beaten.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Will you be able to push luck to your side?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430340/extras/2c3d73a75c12f5c461048ed1edea23cf.poster.avif?t=1773255943\" width=1170 height=382 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430340/extras/2c3d73a75c12f5c461048ed1edea23cf.webm?t=1773255943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430340/extras/2c3d73a75c12f5c461048ed1edea23cf.mp4?t=1773255943\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430340/extras/0a7332b64b5631f2620209aff9856412.avif?t=1773255943\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430340/extras_big/0a7332b64b5631f2620209aff9856412.webp?t=1773255943 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is called &quot;<strong>Dice</strong> <strong>A Million</strong>&quot; but dice alone won't get you anywhere far. Gear up your hand with more than\u00a0<strong>80</strong> <strong>unique rings </strong>with that will act as your passive items. They're always active and trigger wacky effects in your dice.<strong>\u00a0</strong>Get a bunch of them and you'll be hitting those dopamine receptors sooner than later!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430340/extras/464cd336c21bcdca36372adcc4334368.poster.avif?t=1773255943\" width=908 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430340/extras/464cd336c21bcdca36372adcc4334368.webm?t=1773255943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430340/extras/464cd336c21bcdca36372adcc4334368.mp4?t=1773255943\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And most importantly...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Break the game\u00a0</strong><i>(It is one of those)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430340/extras/6d5494a17a243e017dc6390fee73a938.poster.avif?t=1773255943\" width=988 height=566 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430340/extras/6d5494a17a243e017dc6390fee73a938.webm?t=1773255943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430340/extras/6d5494a17a243e017dc6390fee73a938.mp4?t=1773255943\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Sudoku","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3430340/79b525787a3879c36a4fa58abcbc47d4faa0808d.jpg"},{"name":"Mimic Die","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3430340/f5e0b8565a9095b2acf4496a53592aebcef4cff2.jpg"},{"name":"Translucid D4","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3430340/dad5d485bb4ed335ca3e61b9b327f4db79f370ef.jpg"},{"name":"D100","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3430340/217858902b90fc427cc0e1628d2b924852d7f7c7.jpg"},{"name":"Time Bomb","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3430340/1405a8b7e0292d07bc4b85af46a33ee14eadd89c.jpg"},{"name":"Odd of Dice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3430340/9ffdc33d9f7f12769acb444e2d67c71a152c1796.jpg"},{"name":"Even of Dice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/