fferent <strong>hands (classes)</strong> to choose from</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomly generated runs, with <strong>multiple paths and endings</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pickup your phone</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cutting edge next-gen graphics </strong>(not really, I drew all of them on paint)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hundreds of unlocks</strong> and secret achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Millions of pips</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No, really, pickup your phone</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You like big numbers? Sure, got you covered.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430340/extras/20fbf04e240ae2b2a5d257947c6e8af4.poster.avif?t=1773255943\" width=1170 height=514 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430340/extras/20fbf04e240ae2b2a5d257947c6e8af4.webm?t=1773255943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430340/extras/20fbf04e240ae2b2a5d257947c6e8af4.mp4?t=1773255943\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430340/extras/75f5f25dcc7d93781c3765ce254e23e2.avif?t=1773255943\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430340/extras_big/75f5f25dcc7d93781c3765ce254e23e2.webp?t=1773255943 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dice A Million is a roguelike deckbuilder about rolling dice to try and get to a million points. That's the whole <i>point</i>. (get it?!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're trapped in this dice rolling facility, so let's get rolling and try to escape. Combine the effects of more than <strong>120 different</strong> <strong>dice</strong> and discover <strong>powerful synergies</strong>. Get through ever-increasing debts and challenging bosses that will require perfect symbiosis in your bag in order to be beaten.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Will you be able to push luck to your side?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430340/extras/2c3d73a75c12f5c461048ed1edea23cf.poster.avif?t=1773255943\" width=1170 height=382 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430340/extras/2c3d73a75c12f5c461048ed1edea23cf.webm?t=1773255943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430340/extras/2c3d73a75c12f5c461048ed1edea23cf.mp4?t=1773255943\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430340/extras/0a7332b64b5631f2620209aff9856412.avif?t=1773255943\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430340/extras_big/0a7332b64b5631f2620209aff9856412.webp?t=1773255943 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is called &quot;<strong>Dice</strong> <strong>A Million</strong>&quot; but dice alone won't get you anywhere far. Gear up your hand with more than\u00a0<strong>80</strong> <strong>unique rings </strong>with that will act as your passive items. They're always active and trigger wacky effects in your dice.<strong>\u00a0</strong>Get a bunch of them and you'll be hitting t